#: ../../source/gnss/g51b/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"HM-G51B 是一款紧凑型单频多星座 GNSS 接收机模组，支持 L1 频段信号处理， 可接"
"收 GPS L1、北斗 B1、Galileo E1、QZSS L1 和 GLONASS G1，适用于 车载 GNSS 导"
"航、车队管理、资产追踪、AVL/LBS、无人机定位导航和紧凑型定位终端。"
msgstr ""
"The HM-G51B is a compact, single-band multi-constellation GNSS receiver "
"module that supports L1 band signal processing. It can receive GPS L1, "
"BeiDou B1, Galileo E1, QZSS L1, and GLONASS G1 signals, making it suitable "
"for vehicle GNSS navigation, fleet management, asset tracking, AVL/LBS, "
"drone positioning and navigation, and compact positioning terminals."

